<title>USA: TABLE - Arrow-Magnolia Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Arrow-Magnolia Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 months ended June 30:  6 months ended June 30:</p>
<p> Net sales	  $3,314,188 $2,662,343 $6,085,891 $5,143,968</p>
<p> Net earnings	  386,842    289,974    668,554    512,612</p>
<p>   Per share		0.13	 0.10	 0.23	 0.18</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>			 2,901,328  2,828,718  2,900,045  2,798,321</p>
<p>NOTE:  Arrow-Magnolia International Inc said its earnings for all  periods have been restated to reflect a two-for-one stock split in  the form of a 100 percent stock dividend paid in June 1996.</p>
</text>
